  "title": "Different Perspective",
  "storyCode": "6-9",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "db258ccbf6bfebc49a717fef9ecf7c150b0032e7521b454f5b6690bd9d755ec2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Move out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Operator",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "But we're really not familiar with the layout here. I'm worried... what if the Infected resist our operations?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Relax. I know the area. Just follow my orders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Operator",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Yes, Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Operator",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Sir, bad news: intelligence reports Reunion is moving with some degree of organization again. It seems they've found another commander."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Operator",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "And... and they've reencrypted their communication channels. We can't intercept them anymore!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Could they have joined up with the units in the slums?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Impossible. Rhodes Island should already have dealt with the situation there. There's no risk of us getting boxed in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Strange..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Ah Ch'en, I'm ready to——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "A transmission?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "'Little Miss,' would you mind giving me the room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "How do you work it out so you're busy every time I have something for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Is that spy of yours back on the grid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I said give me the room. And get me some finballs while you're out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I'm not a kid, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "...This is Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We have another Reunion element up from the lower levels of the slums."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Infected called Yeti Squad. It seems they have the ability to collapse buildings and destroy infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Tread carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "...Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Only-1, Lungmen's special forces are operating in the slums. We are at the moment incapable of stopping them. Exercise caution."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Roger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "...Only-1, why did you drop out of contact?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I had some things on my mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's clear to me now. I'm leaving Lungmen to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "What? I don't understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Me, now? I don't belong here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Only-1!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'm going to take some of Lungmen's Infected. The L. G. D. can't protect them. The city doesn't care about them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "In other words, this city isn't at all what you think it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Nine! You're under orders!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I haven't been with the L. G. D. for over three years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "And actually it was me giving orders to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Nine...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Those special forces you're talking about? I think I've seen them around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I thought too much of this city. Goodbye, Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh, right. Don't go snooping around the sewers."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Was I too loud?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "You're pretty loud. I think the whole block heard you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "And yet I'm still not as loud as you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Hey, Ah Ch'en, get over here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Have a seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Wow, Miss Swire squatting on a dirty street corner. You're not afraid to soil your clothes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Certainly not! What makes you think I'd worry about a thing like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I was just about to give that stinky sewer rat another call."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I may not come here often, but I'm pretty sure those special forces are up to no good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Have you met Lin? From the slums?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I have. He's a nice old man. Nicer than my grandpa anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "They call him the 'Rat King.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "The men behind the curtain aren't all like such. But he's really a good person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I never thought Yühsia would turn out like this. She was such a shy and timid girl, the kind who would always hide behind you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I don't think she's changed. She just... took on responsibility. Maybe the kind she couldn't handle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "It wouldn't do any good to tell her that. We're between a rock and hard place here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I can't say I understand what's going on between her and her father, but I know she's not so cold-blooded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "So I'm gonna call her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "That report I just got may be of use to us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "A Reunion group with special powers has entered the slums, and they're able to command other Reunion elements."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "And I'm the only one who knows. Well, now it's the two of us, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "What are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "We steer the raincoats into them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Aside from the group left to help the L. G. D. clean up the new-type Infected, there's also quite a few of those special forces with us in the slums."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "And the situation is: we don't know their distribution, we have no way to guard against them, and have no idea what they might do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "But with Lin Yühsia's help, we can guide them into that Reunion team."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Force them out? Show them to the whole L. G. D.?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "The L. G. D., sure, but also Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "You trust them so much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "They chase their objectives harder than any group I've ever seen. They're even more dedicated than the L. G. D."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "And who else are we going to trust?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "You've got stones, I'll give you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Ordinary Lungmenites don't know Lin, they don't know your grandfather, they don't even really know Wei Yenwu, let alone any chambers of commerce or whatever behind the scenes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "They just trust the L. G. D. None of those players would dare disband the L. G. D., and leave us with the regular old police."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Then you add in the outsiders... And there's no way they'll want to take over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "They'll fire you though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Whoop-de-doo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Then let's wrap up this one last job! Next time, their patrol route goes right into the slums."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "You can get Lin on board?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "As long as we look after this place, Lin will work with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "One more thing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "What's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Did you know we have three guests?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Listen up, stinky rat, I've got news for you. There's a Reunion unit we can't hold. We need your team's help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Impossible. What are you trying to pull?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Have I ever lied to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You said we'd go to the same secondary school, only for you to run off to Victoria."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I'm sorry. Really, truly sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Forget it. I don't care."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Yühsia, your dad has done so much for Lungmen. We don't want to lose this place, and the people here can't lose us either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Liar. You're coming here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You'll come to the slums?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......Ch'en will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You really are a terrible liar. What business have I with her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "For whatever reason, your dad wasn't able to resolve the conflict between the Infected and the normal people, but Ch'en can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Ch'en and your father will rebuild the slums together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "They're working to turn it into a place where all kinds of people can live, to the point that we won't even be able to call it the slums anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Think about it... Even though most Lungmenites don't live here, they've been coming here a lot in the past few years, haven't they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Soon, we won't need any slums."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "We haven't been able to solve the Infected crisis, but I know... We can make this a better place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "They'll be Lungmen's downtown Districts 22 to 29. No longer 'slums.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "This city was built on the many, many different kinds of people all coming together to make it what it is today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Lungmen can't afford to lose anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yawn. How boring. You've become as boring as Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Yühsia..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Look, I'm not trying to make a soap opera here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Where is that Reunion unit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I won't ask again."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Amiya, have you entered the slums?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "We have a bit of a situation here. Let me fill you in."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "aliases": [
        "Ch'en"
      ]
